          "message": {
            "text": "paging alert \"HostHighCPU\" (severity=critical) fires on a resource cause (node_cpu_seconds_total) rather than a symptom users feel. Suggestion: page on error rate, latency or SLO burn rate and send this one to a ticket (e.g. severity: warning); for disks, a predict_linear() time-to-full alert is a reasonable page"
          },
          "locations": [
